{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026N7JqpK6dW61795358044.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>警方晚上交代尖沙咀寶勒巷致命車禍，指出事發在下午約兩時半，38歲男子駕駛一輛私家車沿寶勒巷行駛，衝上左邊行人路，撞到四名途人。</p><p></p><p>該司機肇事逃逸，其後被截獲，酒精測試超標。調查發現，事發前該私家車在附近撞到一支交通標誌柱及撞到一架輕型貨車，其後右轉入寶勒巷，釀成今次車禍。</p><p></p><p>兩男兩女傷者，介乎31至70歲，當中一名53歲男子頭部重傷不治。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T16:15:27.507978+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":168,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T14:33:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T03:22:26.232969+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T16:08:35.488086+00:00","content_hash":"ee929d33ede5d25befb302313959fed5dc2f6c1e20ebcb9f2990ed677a28cb74","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}